{"articleNo":"74798","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=74798&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[☆졸업☆]2012학년도 전기 졸업사정내역 제공(졸업가능여부 확인시스템)","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2013.01.28","hit":"6974","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p>&nbsp;<!--StartFragment--><!--StartFragment--> </p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">2012학년도 전기 졸업사정내역</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">을 \"</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #353535; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">졸업가능여부 확인시스템을 이용\"</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">하여 </span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'; LETTER-SPACING: 0.1pt\">아래와 </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">같이 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 14pt; COLOR: #000080; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">제공</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">함을 알려드립니다.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">1. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">제공 기간</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"> : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2013.01.29.(화)～02.06.(수) [18시 마감]</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">2. </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">제공 자료</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"> : 각 이수구분별 졸업관련 내역</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 147.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -147.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 기본자료 : 주전공</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 147.6pt; TEXT-INDENT: -147.6pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 추가이수자료 : 공학인증, 부전공, 복수전공, 연계전공, 교직과정</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">3. <span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #800000; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">경로</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"> : </span></span>원스톱서비스</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #939393; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">〉</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">학사관리</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #939393; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">〉</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">졸업</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; COLOR: #939393; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">〉</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">졸업가능여부 확인자료 조회/출력</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">4. 문의사항</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 공학인증 관련 : 각 학부(과) 행정실</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 공학인증 외 : 교무처 학사관리팀(478-7028)</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">2013. 01. 28.</span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: '맑은 고딕'\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">교 무 처 장</span></strong></span></p><p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: '한컴바탕'\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
